<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-HK">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>CopyPaste · 工作側欄</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="panel.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="audio-production.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="brand">
      <div>
        <img src="icon-48.png" alt="" /><strong>CopyPaste</strong
        ><span>WORKSPACE</span>
      </div>
      <button id="locale" title="Language">EN</button
      ><button id="open-web" title="開啟完整工作台" aria-label="開啟完整工作台">
        ↗
      </button>
    </header>
    <div id="error" class="notice error" role="alert" hidden></div>
    <section id="login" class="login">
      <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SPACE FOR YOUR NEXT IDEA.</p>
      <h1>工作，就從<br /><em>這裡開始。</em></h1>
      <p class="muted">
        把網頁、素材和想法帶到你的工作空間。專業角色，隨時接手下一步。
      </p>
      <button id="sign-in" class="primary">
        透過瀏覽器登入 <span>↗</span>
      </button>
      <p class="footnote">企業帳戶安全登入。本機檔案由你主動選取或授權。</p>
      <div class="login-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <div class="capability">
        <strong>專案裡的每一步，都接得上。</strong
        ><span>設計與品牌 · 行銷分析 · 軟件開發</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="workspace" hidden>
      <div class="workspace-head">
        <small>YOUR WORKSPACE</small><strong id="user-name"></strong>
      </div>
      <div class="workspace-context">
      <label class="field"
        ><span>企業</span
        ><select id="tenant"></select
      ></label>
      <label class="field"
        ><span>專案</span
        ><select id="project"></select
      ></label>
      </div>
      <div id="empty-workspace" class="notice" hidden>
        先開啟完整工作台建立企業與專案，再返回此側欄。
      </div>
      <div id="work-area">
        <section id="client-content" class="client-content" aria-label="工作空間公告 / Workspace notices" tabindex="0" hidden></section>
        <p id="demo-banner" class="notice" role="status" hidden>
          示範環境：AI 回覆及用量為模擬資料，檔案與任務確實保存。
        </p>
        <section id="chat-shell" class="chat-shell" aria-label="CopyPaste conversation">
          <div class="chat-meta">
          <div class="chat-toolbar">
            <button id="chat-new" type="button">＋ 新會話</button>
            <label class="chat-history-field"><span id="chat-history-label" class="sr-only">會話記錄</span><select id="chat-history"></select></label>
            <button id="chat-refresh" type="button">重新整理</button>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-heading"><h1 id="chat-name">今天想完成什麼？</h1><small id="chat-context"></small></div>
          <details id="chat-project-brief" class="chat-project-brief" hidden><summary id="chat-project-summary"></summary><div id="chat-project-content"></div></details>
          </div>
          <div id="chat-messages" class="chat-messages" role="log" aria-label="Messages" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text"></div>
          <div id="chat-unavailable" class="notice error" role="status" hidden></div>
          <div id="chat-pending" class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
          <form id="chat-form" class="chat-composer">
            <div id="chat-attachments" class="chat-attachments" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <label class="sr-only" for="chat-input">Message / 訊息</label>
            <textarea id="chat-input" rows="3" maxlength="30000" placeholder="傳送訊息…"></textarea>
            <div class="chat-compose-actions">
              <label class="chat-attach"><span id="chat-attach-label">附加檔案</span><input type="file" id="chat-file" multiple class="sr-only" /></label>
              <label class="chat-attach"><span id="chat-folder-label">資料夾</span><input type="file" id="chat-folder" webkitdirectory multiple class="sr-only" aria-label="Choose folder / 選擇資料夾" /></label>
              <button id="chat-capture" type="button">目前網頁</button>
              <button id="chat-stop" type="button" hidden>停止</button>
              <button id="chat-send" class="chat-send" type="submit">傳送 ↑</button>
            </div>
            <small id="chat-cloud-note" class="chat-cloud-note">獲選檔案上傳至公司雲端的私人會話，由雲端助手處理。分享至專案需另外確認。</small>
            <details class="chat-settings"><summary id="chat-settings-label">角色與預算</summary>
              <label class="field"><span id="chat-agent-label">專業角色</span><select id="chat-agent"></select></label>
              <label class="field"><span id="chat-budget-label">每條訊息預算上限（HKD）</span><input id="chat-budget" type="text" inputmode="decimal" value="20" required /></label>
            </details>
            <small id="chat-cost" class="chat-cloud-note" role="status"></small>
          </form>
        </section>
        <dialog id="folder-review" class="folder-review" aria-labelledby="folder-title" aria-describedby="folder-note">
          <div class="folder-heading"><small>CopyPaste · Files</small><h2 id="folder-title"></h2><strong id="folder-root"></strong><p id="folder-summary"></p></div>
          <p id="folder-note"></p>
          <div id="folder-files" class="folder-files" role="group" aria-label="Selected folder files / 所選資料夾檔案"></div>
          <div class="folder-footer"><progress id="folder-progress" hidden></progress><p id="folder-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div><button id="folder-cancel" type="button"></button><button id="folder-confirm" type="button" autofocus></button></div></div>
        </dialog>
        <details id="workspace-tools" class="workspace-tools">
          <summary>工作、通知與帳戶 / Work, notices & account</summary>
        <details id="publication-workspace" class="publication-workspace" hidden></details>
        <details id="creative-package-workspace" class="publication-workspace" hidden></details>
        <form id="brief-form">
          <button type="button" id="review-models" class="secondary">
            檢視模型與費率版本
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="cloud-computers" class="secondary" hidden>
            開啟雲端電腦工作台
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="batch-designs" class="secondary">
            批量設計工作台
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="video-workspace" class="secondary">
            影片製作工作台
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="marketing-connections" class="secondary">
            營銷帳戶與同步
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="website-audits" class="secondary">
            網站診斷與復查
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="creative-feedback" class="secondary">
            創意與廣告反饋
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="geo-observations" class="secondary">
            GEO雲端樣本觀測
          </button>
          <label class="field"
            ><span>選擇助手或專業角色</span
            ><select id="role" name="role"></select></label
          ><label class="field"
            ><span>工作名稱</span
            ><input
              name="title"
              maxlength="160"
              placeholder="例如：新品推廣企劃"
              required /></label
          ><label class="field"
            ><span>你想完成什麼？</span
            ><textarea
              id="prompt"
              name="prompt"
              rows="5"
              minlength="5"
              maxlength="30000"
              placeholder="描述目標、交付格式和需要保留的內容…"
              required
            ></textarea>
          </label>
          <div class="tools">
            <button type="button" id="capture-page">＋ 目前網頁</button
            ><label class="file-button"
              >＋ 選取檔案<input type="file" id="file-input" hidden
            /></label>
          </div>
          <small id="capture-note" class="hint"></small
          ><small id="file-note" class="hint"></small
          ><label class="field"
            ><span>開始前需要補齊資料嗎？</span
            ><select name="required_input">
              <option value="">資料已齊，可開始</option>
              <option value="file">先等我提供檔案</option>
            </select></label
          ><label class="field budget"
            ><span>預算上限（HKD）</span
            ><input
              name="budget"
              type="number"
              min="1"
              max="10000"
              step="0.01"
              value="20"
              required /></label
          ><button id="create-task" class="primary" type="submit">
            開始工作 <span>↗</span>
          </button>
        </form>
        <section id="task-view" class="task-view" hidden>
          <div>
            <h2 id="task-title"></h2>
            <button id="close-task" aria-label="關閉工作詳情">×</button>
          </div>
          <span id="task-status" class="badge"></span>
          <pre id="task-output"></pre>
          <div id="generated-videos"></div>
          <div id="audio-productions"></div>
          <div id="cloud-schedules"></div>
          <div id="cloud-events"></div>
          <div id="delivery-quality"></div>
          <div id="input-requests" hidden></div>
          <button id="control-task" class="secondary" hidden></button>
          <button id="cancel-task" class="secondary">取消工作</button>
        </section>
        <section class="recent">
          <h2>工作通知</h2>
          <button id="refresh-notifications" class="secondary" type="button">
            重新整理通知
          </button>
          <p class="hint">最近 20 條；完整記錄請開啟工作台。</p>
          <div id="notification-list"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="recent">
          <h2 id="entitlement-heading">目前可用權益</h2>
          <button id="refresh-entitlements" class="secondary" type="button">
            更新權益
          </button>
          <div id="entitlement-summary" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <p class="hint" id="entitlement-hint">
            使用時仍會檢查專案權限、本機授權與預算。通知顯示最近 5
            條，完整記錄請開啟工作台。
          </p>
          <div id="entitlement-notices"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="recent" aria-labelledby="financial-heading">
          <h2 id="financial-heading">費用與帳戶通知</h2>
          <button id="refresh-financial" class="secondary" type="button">
            更新帳戶與通知
          </button>
          <p id="financial-hint" class="hint">
            企業帳戶通知只對目前的 Owner 或 Admin
            顯示。通知保留歷史變更，目前餘額以最新確認結果為準。
          </p>
          <div id="financial-summary"></div>
          <label class="financial-filter"
            ><input type="checkbox" id="financial-unread" />
            <span>只看未讀</span></label
          >
          <p
            id="financial-status"
            class="hint"
            role="status"
            aria-atomic="true"
          ></p>
          <div id="financial-notices"></div>
          <p class="hint">
            最近 5 條帳戶通知；工作預留、消費及較早記錄可在完整工作台查看。
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="recent">
          <h2>最近的工作</h2>
          <div id="task-list"></div>
        </section>
        <details class="native">
          <summary>本機目錄授權</summary>
          <p>
            需要安裝 CopyPaste Desktop
            原生助手。每個目錄由你選擇，雲端不能任意存取本機路徑。
          </p>
          <button id="choose-folder" class="secondary">選擇並授權目錄</button
          ><small id="folder-note"></small
          ><button id="refresh-folders" class="secondary" type="button">
            載入已授權目錄
          </button>
          <div id="folder-browser" hidden>
            <label class="field"
              ><span>資料夾授權</span
              ><select id="folder-grant"></select></label
            ><label class="field"
              ><span>相對路徑</span><input id="local-path" value="."
            /></label>
            <div class="tools">
              <button id="local-list" type="button">列出檔案</button
              ><button id="local-read" type="button">讀取預覽</button>
            </div>
            <div id="local-listing"></div>
            <pre id="local-preview"></pre>
            <button id="local-upload" class="secondary" type="button">
              上傳至專案</button
            ><label class="field"
              ><span>新檔內容（只限已授予寫入權限）</span
              ><textarea id="local-content" rows="3"></textarea></label
            ><button id="local-write" class="secondary" type="button">
              建立新檔案</button
            ><button id="local-revoke" class="secondary" type="button">
              撤銷此授權
            </button>
          </div>
        </details>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer id="account-actions" hidden>
      <button id="sign-out">登出</button><span>HONG KONG · COPYPASTE</span>
    </footer>
    <script src="panel.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
